title: Sophos Firewall: System information
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/sophos
license: GPLv2
distribution: https://github.com/KeksDipp/checkmk-plugins
description:
 Shows model, firmware version and serial number of a Sophos Firewall (SFOS),
 plus the IPS pattern and web category versions. The number of live users and
 the HTTP hit rate are recorded as metrics. The service is always {OK}.

 CPU utilization is not part of the SFOS MIB; it is covered by the built-in
 check {hr_cpu} (HOST-RESOURCES-MIB).

discovery:
 One service is created for each Sophos Firewall (sysObjectID .1.3.6.1.4.1.2604.5).
